      <li><a href="https://dekalbcountyilsheriff.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Policy-606-Unmanned_Aerial_System__UAS__Operations.pdf">DeKalb County Sheriff — UAS Policy 606</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://agency.icjia-api.cloud/uploads/SFY_24_Drone_Report_with_Appendices_491dfa4810.pdf">Illinois SFY 2024 Freedom from Drone Surveillance Act report</a></li>
