    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">UNRESOLVED</p>
    <h2>Not established by the published records.</h2>
    <ul class="about_questions">
      <li>Whether the 2026 Flock service replaces, integrates with, or operates alongside remaining Genetec fixed readers.</li>
      <li>The current Flock camera count, locations, retention, sharing settings, authorized-user count, and audit results.</li>
      <li>Which Axon Fusus modules and external video sources are configured, rather than merely licensed.</li>
      <li>Current drone models, payloads, complete flight records, retention, and mutual-aid use.</li>
      <li>Current Sheriff's Office ALPR contracts, policies, and network access.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
